# AIXSHOP v1.0 — Workstream B: Audit History & Evidence
## Google AI Studio Build Mode Implementation Prompt

### 1. Mission

Implement a complete, workspace-isolated, persistent Audit History & Evidence system on top of the existing AIXSHOP v1.0 Phase 1 Real Audit Execution implementation.

The objective is to allow merchants to:

1. View their previous audit executions.
2. Open any completed audit and inspect its historical findings.
3. See the actual product information and evidence associated with each finding at the time of that audit.
4. Understand which rules were executed and when.
5. Review the original evidence provenance, including evidence type, issuer, URL, verification status, and verification date where available.
6. Compare historical audit results with newer audit runs without changing the historical records.
7. Retrieve historical records even after the current catalog has changed or been re-audited.

**Core requirement: An audit result must remain historically accurate even when the current catalog changes.**

This is a targeted extension of Phase 1, not a rebuild.

**Zero Loss of Development Progress.**

