### 11. Security and Multi-Tenant Isolation

Workspace isolation is mandatory.

Verify:

1. A workspace can retrieve only its own Audit Runs.
2. A workspace can retrieve only its own historical findings.
3. A workspace can retrieve only its own historical evidence.
4. A workspace cannot access another workspace's snapshot using a guessed Audit Run ID.
5. Client-provided workspace IDs cannot override server-side authorization.
6. Historical API queries always use the authenticated workspace scope.
7. Evidence URLs and metadata do not expose unauthorized tenant information.
8. Historical snapshots cannot be modified through ordinary catalog APIs.

Reuse the existing authentication middleware and workspace authorization.

Do not introduce a separate authorization architecture.

